://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109175","id":3141089027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67OTcD","user":{"login":"paulGeoghegan","id":56843333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODQzMzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56843333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan","html_url":"https://github.com/paulGeoghegan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T19:18:36Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T19:18:36Z","body":"@bruvzg I made a video to show you. I can't tell what's going on visually so this should help.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f1c4204-1869-425e-a0ce-3e26dff064a7","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141089027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141116117","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109175#issuecomment-3141116117","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109175","id":3141116117,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67OaDV","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T19:30:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T19:30:51Z","body":"> I made a video to show you.\n\nIt seems to stay on the \"Import\" button, since the wrong window is focused for some reason, I'll check why this can happen.\n\nThere are two open windows:\n- Main project manager window (with \"Import\" button selected).\n- \"Import Existing Project\" window, which also has \"Import\" button selected.\n\n\"Import Existing Project\" window is an exclusive child window of the main window (blocks input to it), but for some reason, main window has focus instead of \"Import Existing Project\" window.\n\nI guess it's a generic issue with all Godot window interfaces, you can move focus to the parent window with exclusive child, and it will trap keyboard focus.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141116117/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141121295","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109175#issuecomment-3141121295","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109175","id":3141121295,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67ObUP","user":{"login":"paulGeoghegan","id":56843333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODQzMzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56843333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan","html_url":"https://github.com/paulGeoghegan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulGeoghegan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T19:32:22Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T19:32:22Z","body":"> > I made a video to show you.\n> \n> It seems to stay on the \"Import\" button, since the wrong window is focused for some reason, I'll check why this can happen.\n> \n> There are two open windows:\n> \n>     * Main project manager window (with \"Import\" button selected).\n> \n>     * \"Import Existing Project\" window, which also has \"Import\" button selected.\n> \n> \n> \"Import Existing Project\" window is an exclusive child window of the main window (blocks input to it), but for some reason, main window has focus instead of \"Import Existing Project\" window.\n> \n> I guess it's a generic issue with all Godot window interfaces, you can move focus to the parent window with exclusive child, and it will trap keyboard focus.\n\nOkay, well I'm glad you know what the issue is now. Thanks for your help.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141121295/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]